  <text x="430" y="125" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#CBD5E1">&gt; short summary</text>
  <text x="430" y="144" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#38BDF8">## Guides</text>
  <text x="430" y="163" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#7DD3FC">- /important-page</text>

